    "statement": "For the balanced (6,6) CE incidence, the statement 'the image of the reduced-support open of AJ_B in M_{6,6} has dimension dim B+2 (codimension 19-dim B)' is not a consequence of the P^2-bundle identification AJ_B=P(p_*L_B) plus geometric-point injectivity alone: the reduced-support locus is an open subset of the projective bundle and may be empty over a component (e.g. if |L| has a non-reduced fixed part). It must be conditionalized on existence of a reduced member of |L| over the components considered, or the nonemptiness must be proved. ATT-0063 asserts the clause unconditionally in theorem part (G) while recording nonemptiness as open (GAP-RANK-BPF), an internal conflict of the FND-0101 type.",
